{"w":2400,"h":3209,"lines":[{"x":0.09311460704677231,"y":0.037406883355436626,"w":0.12056690216064452,"h":0.01675600069705574,"t":"Audioscripts","c":1},{"t":"But first, his early career ... as I've said, he was a writer, he was at the height of his career in","x":0.097028619507957214,"w":0.73020019531249991,"y":0.086906313194189955,"h":0.017006215722390139,"c":1},{"t":"Paris and he was very highly regarded by his colleagues. As far as literature was concerned,","x":0.097000660431792479,"y":0.10242308032843839,"c":1,"w":0.73028503417968749,"h":0.017010531321492883},{"t":"he was the leading figure of the Romantic movement. However, as well as being a literary","y":0.11824758595280982,"h":0.017840330177378405,"w":0.70697550455729175,"c":1,"x":0.096992231858426689},{"t":"genius, he also gave many speeches about issues like the level of poverty in his society. He","h":0.014534884301301454,"w":0.72815531412760415,"x":0.09320389620820578,"y":0.136627906683505,"c":1},{"y":0.15183016397876692,"w":0.73605743408203128,"c":1,"t":"felt very strongly about this and about other areas where change was needed, like education.","x":0.095079166412663479,"h":0.015694262305524065},{"t":"This kind of outspoken criticism was not well liked by the rulers of France and, eventually, the","x":0.093135556137452044,"w":0.73605728149414062,"h":0.017536103316928009,"c":1,"y":0.16799443780241463},{"h":0.022994457969784388,"c":1,"w":0.71295140584309902,"t":"emperor - Napoleon III - told Victor Hugo to leave Paris and not return; in other words, he","x":0.093053835643015739,"y":0.18075350100512821},{"t":"So Victor Hugo was forced to reside in other parts of Europe. Guernsey was actually his third","w":0.73410975138346346,"h":0.018094069341261454,"y":0.22484388940041655,"c":1,"x":0.093136423202418731},{"h":0.01737436193543429,"y":0.23993268369000531,"x":0.095082005558733251,"t":"place of exile and he landed there in 1855. He produced a lot while on Guernsey - including","c":1,"w":0.72444040934244791},{"c":1,"y":0.25856697799738626,"x":0.093203895223563787,"t":"Les Miserables - and to do this, he had to spend a great deal of time in the home that he","w":0.70291259765625003,"h":0.013235347664616204},{"y":0.27299205589704734,"w":0.73605224609374997,"t":"had there. This was a property that he bought using the money he'd made in France from the","x":0.093137237362720296,"c":1,"h":0.017188789391443304},{"t":"publication of a collection of his poetry. It was the only property he ever owned, and he was","h":0.018529418992847546,"c":1,"y":0.28873240067478112,"x":0.093105112393137499,"w":0.7205853780110677},{"w":0.12815533955891928,"h":0.014534883112922281,"t":"very proud of it.","c":1,"x":0.091262136968113153,"y":0.3052325582618528},{"h":0.020328158084477188,"c":1,"y":0.35018990799173855,"w":0.7167194112141928,"t":"The property Victor Hugo bought on Guernsey was a large, five-storey house in the capital","x":0.093077423038139762},{"y":0.36717925111277161,"w":0.68563090006510419,"x":0.091162956941470738,"c":1,"h":0.019197732562959313,"t":"town of St Peter Port and he lived there for 15 years, returning to France in 1870 when"},{"t":"Napoleon's Empire collapsed. He decorated and furnished each level, or floor, of the house in","x":0.093074451156878693,"h":0.020456892827589668,"y":0.38180121452032489,"c":1,"w":0.74005844116210928},{"h":0.019439324114552958,"y":0.39960913445278901,"c":1,"t":"unique and wonderful ways, and many people consider the inside of the house to be a 'work","x":0.091171461949638322,"w":0.73026667277018231},{"c":1,"y":0.4156204863341435,"t":"of art'. Today it's a museum that attracts 200,000 visitors a year.","x":0.091178740241040501,"w":0.50697962443033839,"h":0.018152958878846936},{"y":0.43991099764633068,"w":0.738053232828776,"t":"He lived in the house with his family... and portraits of its members still hang in rooms on the","x":0.091167036433007234,"c":1,"h":0.018564366254479658},{"c":1,"h":0.017770154602431143,"w":0.72243560791015626,"t":"ground floor, along with drawings that he did during his travels that he felt were important to","x":0.091215187157784691,"y":0.45623778115258418},{"y":0.47327440569434698,"t":"him. In other ground-floor rooms, there are huge tapestries that he would have designed and","h":0.018078804610302868,"c":1,"x":0.091183851541789138,"w":0.73218165079752606},{"h":0.017301155399310542,"t":"loved. The walls are covered in dark wood panelling that Victor Hugo created himself using","x":0.08925046010028638,"y":0.48909887279884345,"c":1,"w":0.72053680419921873},{"x":0.089201182091752096,"c":1,"y":0.50375152078238306,"t":"wooden furniture that he bought in the market. The items were relatively inexpensive, and he","h":0.019948335451500432,"w":0.73423787434895837},{"y":0.52325581365842533,"h":0.014534884301301454,"t":"used them to create intricate carvings. They gave an atmosphere on the lower level that was","w":0.73009709676106771,"x":0.091262131005665409,"c":1},{"y":0.53924418634294535,"t":"shadowy and rather solemn.","x":0.08932039230614916,"h":0.014649894452911982,"c":1,"w":0.22912620544433596},{"t":"On the next level of the house there are two impressive lounges, where he entertained his","x":0.091164784382941566,"w":0.71085525512695313,"y":0.56195498425253354,"h":0.020160270999896479,"c":1},{"h":0.020322066452644338,"c":1,"x":0.089238042179331858,"t":"guests. One lounge has entirely red furnishings, such as sofas and wall coverings, and the","y":0.57738643252778921,"w":0.71668757120768234},{"h":0.014661668319939869,"y":0.59593023226575159,"c":1,"t":"other blue. There's a strong Chinese influence in these areas in things like the wallpaper","x":0.091262131868863131,"w":0.69902913411458334},{"h":0.019041399495252631,"y":0.60982880179305032,"w":0.70118779500325512,"c":1,"t":"pattern and the lamps - which he would have made himself by copying original versions.","x":0.091163876099457378},{"w":0.72638778686523442,"c":1,"x":0.091162780928156814,"y":0.63513407531034549,"t":"His library, where he left many of his favourite books, forms the hallway to the third floor and","h":0.020032420410916796},{"c":1,"y":0.65218209924795689,"x":0.08925507435322004,"h":0.01736335873232453,"t":"was a comfortable area where he could relax and enjoy his afternoons. And then, at the very","w":0.73217473347981776},{"h":0.017584039563330545,"c":1,"x":0.089320389393409985,"w":0.73786407470703119,"t":"top of the house, there's a room called the Lookout - called that because it looks out over the","y":0.6671511626685227},{"w":0.72621358235677091,"x":0.089320393187588248,"y":0.68598130853356709,"c":1,"h":0.014641744548286595,"t":"harbour. In contrast to the rather dark lower levels, it's full of light and was like a glass office"},{"c":1,"h":0.014909185724466312,"w":0.44675867716471351,"t":"where he would write until lunchtime - often at his desk.","x":0.089252187689671705,"y":0.70033922566475915},{"c":1,"t":"So, Victor Hugo was a man of many talents, but he was also true to his values. While living in","w":0.73592234293619796,"y":0.72523364486931041,"x":0.091262129303876893,"h":0.016199376947040434},{"t":"his house on Guernsey, he entertained many other famous writers, but he also invited a large","x":0.091187065593970357,"h":0.018317976621823884,"c":1,"y":0.74097014397261252,"w":0.73800628662109369},{"y":0.756840249878872,"x":0.089279137945462522,"w":0.71659434000651046,"c":1,"h":0.016582907323153928,"t":"group of local children from the deprived areas of the island to dinner once a week. What's"},{"w":0.6991548156738282,"h":0.018117321763083227,"c":1,"t":"more, he served them their food, which was an extraordinary gesture for the time period.","y":0.77271545112671414,"x":0.091206410788911493},{"y":0.79651162817259613,"c":1,"w":0.71067957560221362,"x":0.08932039880083513,"h":0.017507063488351182,"t":"In 1927, the house was owned by his relatives, and they decided to donate it to the city of"},{"w":0.697198232014974,"t":"Paris. It has since been restored using photographs from the period and, as I mentioned","x":0.089264861635376933,"y":0.81364618011763623,"c":1,"h":0.01809815261222858},{"h":0.017601448130384778,"c":1,"t":"earlier, is now a museum that is open to the public.","x":0.08922555995759486,"y":0.82979021499061889,"w":0.40408487955729167},{"x":0.089320388962281852,"w":0.036893202463785815,"h":0.013081395514657479,"c":1,"y":0.95494186034373141,"t":"118"},{"x":0.8582524276992497,"t":"Q32","c":1,"w":0.040776697794596362,"y":0.13808139522958984,"h":0.01308139551465759},{"w":0.036893202463785801,"t":"Q33","x":0.85825242779723343,"h":0.01308139551465759,"y":0.22674418592512668,"c":1},{"t":"Q34","x":0.85631068017812295,"h":0.01308139551465759,"w":0.038834950129191026,"c":1,"y":0.27616279057842696},{"h":0.014534883112922281,"c":1,"w":0.038834950129191026,"y":0.4912790700286962,"t":"Q36","x":0.85436893261101854},{"t":"Q37","c":1,"h":0.01308139551465759,"y":0.59738372081098512,"x":0.85436893265699609,"w":0.036893202463785801},{"y":0.6700581394156363,"t":"Q38","c":1,"w":0.036893202463785801,"x":0.85436893265699609,"h":0.01308139551465759},{"w":0.036893202463785801,"t":"Q39","y":0.74273255839811736,"x":0.85436893265767022,"h":0.014534883112922281,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"Q40","h":0.01308139551465759,"x":0.85436893265767022,"y":0.79941860452737323,"w":0.036893202463785801}]}